# Spec orchestration

Read and follow `docs/spec/AGENTS.md` before creating a spec, splitting domains, or implementing from a spec.

The chat that receives "make a full spec out of a criteria.md" is the orchestrator entry point. Split the criteria into domain specs under `docs/spec/<NNN>-<slug>/`, then farm each domain spec to a separate subagent. Do not implement product code in the orchestrator.
